{"id": "t060-009", "text": "Dana said her dad's been really struggling since he retired in the summer, doesn't know what to do with himself. He was a bus driver for nearly forty years and now just sits watching quiz shows. Her mum's fed up. Dana's trying to get him into the allotment or volunteering at the food bank on Tuesdays. Check in with her next week about how he's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retired", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't know what to do with himself", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "bus driver for nearly forty years", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "quiz shows", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesdays"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
