{"id": "t060-033", "text": "Bumped into Isaac at the station. His partner Andre has his PhD viva on Tuesday 10 November 2026 at 2pm, been five years in the making. Andre's barely sleeping and keeps rewriting his slides. Isaac's taking the afternoon off to wait outside with snacks. Their kids are staying at Isaac's mum's that night. Ask Isaac on the Wednesday how it went, and maybe get Andre something to celebrate if it goes well.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD viva", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday 10 November 2026 at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Isaac", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get Andre something to celebrate", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
